    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking - permutations</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/permutations/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 46</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Permutations</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Fill the answer one slot at a time: any element not used yet may take the next slot, so loop over all n with a <code>used[]</code> mask (or swap into place), recurse, then undo. n! leaves, each copied once: Θ(n·n!) time, O(n) extra space.</p>\n"
